  "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nAdd face, edge, corner and center finding operations. \n\nFinding is a common operation at various points in a machining process.   I think it should be an operation in CAMCraft.\n\n### How you imagine it working\n\nI think a finding operation should be done based on picking a specific geometry on a part (face, edge, corner (vertice) or hole on the solid.   \n\nAllow the operation to have the option of having the machine automatically reset the coordinate system based or querying the operator to confirm the result.   If the found coordinate are too far out from the expected coordinates, the operator should be warned.  ",
